   "text": "ON DELETE (verified in the migrations)\nRESTRICT : memberships.department_id, document_departments.department_id\n           documents.owner_department_id (ADR-009)\nSET NULL : invitations.department_id, documents.category_id\nNO ACTION: workspaces.created_by, documents.created_by,\n           invitations.invited_by / accepted_by, document_versions.uploaded_by\nCASCADE  : every other FK (core and rag)",
